# Bridge Coding Rules

## Workflow
**PREP → BUILD → VERIFY.** Even a 5-line fix gets a 2-sentence plan (files + signatures).

## Code Quality
- Fix root cause, not symptoms
- No silent catches, no magic numbers
- Match existing patterns

## UI (Light-First)
Apple spatial + SpaceX industrial.

| Token | Value |
|-------|-------|
| Canvas | `#F5F5F7` |
| Surfaces | white |
| Text | `#1D1D1F` |
| Primary | `#0071E3` (Apple Blue) |
| Chrome | `#111111` |
| Destructive | `#E82127` (SpaceX red) |

**Type:** SF Pro / -apple-system UI, Space Grotesk headlines, JetBrains Mono data. Never Inter/Roboto/Arial alone.

**Retired:** dark-first, Electric Indigo `#7C3AED` — unless spec names them.

## Safety
- Do not merge to main
- Do not deploy
- No secrets or real customer data in repo
